  "title": "1999 Bayliner 3055 Ciera Sunbridge",
  "handle": "1999-bayliner-3055-ciera-sunbridge-1342",
  "descriptionHtml": "<h3 data-end=\"255\" data-start=\"174\"><strong><span data-end=\"253\" data-start=\"181\">1</span></strong><strong data-end=\"253\" data-start=\"181\">999 Bayliner 3055 Ciera Twin 5.0L MerCruisers (Recently Rebuilt!)</strong></h3><p data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"290\"><span><strong>End of Season Special Pricing!&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p>Set your course for adventure with this <strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"330\">well-maintained 1999 Bayliner 3055 Ciera</strong>, powered by <strong data-end=\"419\" data-start=\"387\">twin MerCruiser 5.0L engines</strong> both recently rebuilt for smooth, reliable performance. This popular express cruiser offers the perfect blend of comfort, space, and power for long weekends on the water.</p><h4 data-end=\"629\" data-start=\"596\"><strong data-end=\"629\" data-start=\"604\">Highlights &amp; Upgrades</strong></h4><ul data-end=\"1125\" data-start=\"630\">\t<li data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"630\">\t<p data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"632\"><strong data-end=\"664\" data-start=\"632\">Twin MerCruiser 5.0L Engines</strong> both rebuilt, offering strong, dependable performance</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"723\">\t<p data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"725\"><strong data-end=\"744\" data-start=\"725\">Bravo III Drives</strong> for better control and efficiency</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"781\">\t<p data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"783\"><strong data-end=\"810\" data-start=\"783\">Spacious Cockpit Layout</strong> with wraparound seating great for entertaining</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"862\">\t<p data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"864\"><strong data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"864\">Full Camper Canvas Enclosure</strong> for shade or overnight stays</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"928\">\t<p data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"930\"><strong data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"930\">Swim Platform with Ladder</strong> easy access for swimming or water sports</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1051\" data-start=\"1005\">\t<p data-end=\"1051\" data-start=\"1007\"><strong data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"1007\">Windlass Anchor</strong> for effortless mooring</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1090\" data-start=\"1052\">\t<p data-end=\"1090\" data-start=\"1054\"><strong data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"1054\">GPS / Depth Finder / VHF Radio</strong></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1125\" data-start=\"1093\"><strong data-end=\"1123\" data-start=\"1093\">Dual Batteries with Switch</strong></li>\t<li>\t<p><span>3 New Isinglass Panels for the front windows.&nbsp;</span></p>\t</li>\t<li>\t<p><span>Sunscreen for the boat</span>- perfect for getting some shade while enjoying time out on the water.</p>\t</li></ul><h4 data-end=\"1157\" data-start=\"1127\"><strong data-end=\"1157\" data-start=\"1136\">Interior Comforts</strong></h4><ul data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1158\">\t<li data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1158\">\t<p data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1160\">Sleeps up to 6 with <strong data-end=\"1241\" data-start=\"1180\">forward V-berth, mid-cabin berth, and convertible dinette</strong></p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1244\">\t<p data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1246\">Fully equipped <strong data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1261\">galley</strong> with stove, sink, refrigerator, and microwave</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1386\" data-start=\"1320\">\t<p data-end=\"1386\" data-start=\"1322\"><strong data-end=\"1347\" data-start=\"1322\">Private enclosed head</strong> with sink, shower, and marine toilet</p>\t</li>\t<li data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1387\">\t<p data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1389\"><strong data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1389\">Air conditioning &amp; heat</strong> for all-season comfort</p>\t</li></ul><h4 data-end=\"1473\" data-start=\"1443\"><strong data-end=\"1473\" data-start=\"1451\">Why You'll Love It</strong></h4><p data-end=\"1738\" data-start=\"1474\">This Bayliner 3055 is one of the most popular express cruisers in her class offering a roomy cockpit for daytime cruising and a surprisingly spacious cabin for overnight adventures. With her freshly rebuilt engines, she's ready for seasons of worry-free boating.</p><p data-end=\"1858\" data-start=\"1740\">Perfect for families, weekend cruisers, or anyone ready to enjoy the boating lifestyle without the new-boat price tag.</p>",
